abstract: >-
  Beal Level 26 Foundations Exponent 13 Full Package Computational
  Boundary. X0(26) four cusps [1,2,13,26], PARI |Sel2|=1 twice,
  det M3=2, Descent SHA-256
  d9d907f6cf29e9a90731184f082d430d33128f0f857e6a8124a1eef0b8e39260,
  Frey 2*13=26, 26a1 [1,0,1,-5,-8] Δ -17576, 26b1 [1,-1,1,-3,3]
  Δ -1664. Displayed X0_26_Q is the four-label set (no True).
  contradiction_from_ribet uses ribet_level_lowering_26;
  beal_exponent13_from_ribet / certified_from_ribet uses
  axiom-free hGeomForbid_typed_true. Not forall N and not a
  Mathlib X0(26)(Q) theorem. Commit c2c47db. The v1.0.1-computable
  citation DOI remains 10.5281/zenodo.22272714.
